{"abstract":"GenFrame is an interactive picture frame that mimics traditional paintings while being equipped with generative AI capabilities. Painting \"portraits of a girl\"has been a trope in art history for centuries. However, in the era of generative AI models, the permanence of traditional art is challenged. When an AI model is able to mimic any painting style, it can also give agency to the viewer to repaint the painting per individual desires. In this installation, we modify the role of the museum placard to provide a minimal tangible interface to change the style of the image and the mood of the depicted girl. In this way, the generative AI model is interfaced in tangible ways, instead of the regular prompt paradigm.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Kun, Peter","Freiberger, Matthias","Risi, Sebastian","Løvlie, Anders Sundnes"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-810858"],"event":{"end":"2024-07-05","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2024-07-01","title":"2024 ACM Designing Interactive Systems Conference, DIS 2024","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["AI art","Generative AI","Image Generation","Interactive art"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"genframe an interactive picture frame painting the portrait of any girl","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3656156.3665437","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-810858","identifier":[{"id":"85198907015","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-ba56ce57-55c5-4227-9110-1104cf6fc32a"],"keyword":["AI art","AI-generated painting","generative AI","image generation","interactive art"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-72F7A198D25F70B3955D47B1C4B823CF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3656156.3665437","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/444851222/GenFrame.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Computer Science, Pioneer AI (P1AI)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Peter","key":"kunpau","last":"Kun","name":"Kun, Peter","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Matthias","key":"freibergerpau","last":"Freiberger","locid":"58e199e0-71a9-4f89-a2b1-97346c7d29e8","name":"Freiberger, Matthias","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Sebastian","key":"risipau","last":"Risi","name":"Risi, Sebastian","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Anders Sundnes","key":"løvliepau","last":"Løvlie","name":"Løvlie, Anders Sundnes","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3656156.3665437","eisbn":["9798400706325"],"pages":"353-358","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery, Inc.","series":"DIS 2024 - Proceedings of the 2024 ACM Designing Interactive Systems Conference","status":"p","title":"DIS 2024 - Proceedings of the 2024 ACM Designing Interactive Systems Conference"},"re